ap 0.9712376466, structure 0.9964494245; structure reference signs 1.0000000000, repeat metrics [1.0, 1.0], stored conditional query CI [0.9959843487120774, 0.9968429356993416]. [final.evidence.episodes]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
